All benchmarks were executed on an actual 1 GB / 20,000-file tree. The per-file overhead (~370–390 µs) is dominating the throughput — before writing up the budget derivation, let's break down where that time is being spent (makedirs vs link vs write vs stat). This will determine whether the design should pre-create directories:
